---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Support | Monisankar Nath – Software Engineer"
  description="Support Monisankar Nath, Software Engineer, in creating open source software and technical content for the development community."
>
  <div class="container">
    <article class="support section">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">← Home</a>

      <h1>Support</h1>

      <div class="content">
        <p class="intro text-secondary">
          If my open source work or writing has been helpful to you, you can
          support continued development through a voluntary contribution.
        </p>

        <h2>What Your Support Enables</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Maintenance and improvements to <strong>expo-video-cache</strong> and
            other libraries
          </li>
          <li>In-depth technical articles and case studies</li>
          <li>Documentation and example projects</li>
          <li>Responding to issues and feature requests</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Contribute via UPI</h2>
        <div class="upi-section">
          <div class="upi-info card">
            <p class="upi-id mono">monisankarnath@upi</p>
            <p class="upi-note text-muted">
              Scan the QR code or use the UPI ID above
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="qr-placeholder card">
            <p class="text-muted">QR code will be added here</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="disclaimer">
          <p class="text-muted">
            <strong>Note:</strong> Contributions are voluntary support for open source
            development and writing. They are not payments for services, and do not
            create any obligation or expectation of specific work.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h2>Other Ways to Support</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Star repositories on <a
              href="https://github.com/moni-synt"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
          </li>
          <li>Share articles that you find useful</li>
          <li>Report bugs and contribute fixes</li>
          <li>Provide feedback on documentation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .support {
    padding-block: var(--space-12);
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-h1);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .content {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
  }

  .intro {
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .content h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-h2);
    margin-top: var(--space-12);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .content ul {
    padding-left: var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .content li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .upi-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .upi-info {
    padding: var(--space-6);
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 200px;
  }

  .upi-id {
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
  }

  .upi-note {
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .qr-placeholder {
    width: 160px;
    height: 160px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--space-4);
    font-size: var(--text-small);
  }

  .disclaimer {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    background-color: var(--color-bg-surface);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-text-muted);
    border-radius: 0 0.5rem 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .disclaimer p {
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
